[statement]
As `provided-names-are-decided-depth-first-v-reached-first`, with `app`
listing `B` first: `w` is decided first and installs `kw`, which then
provides `v`. The shape of the Alpine neochat case
(`reduced/neochat-takes-kwallet-alone`).

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:B A

P:pa
V:1
p:A=1
D:v

P:pb
V:1
p:B=1
D:w

P:kw
V:1
p:v w=1

P:gk
V:1
p:v
k:100

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install kw 1
install pb 1
install pa 1
install app 1
